roner worth NOK8.815 billion. \par \par \uc2  Separately Storvik ascribed the krone's weakening over the past months to a combination of international financial truculence, low crude oil prices and excessive wage settlements between labor unions and employers this year. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 16-12-98 \par \par \uc2  1133GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917ducg022lx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
