chmark 2007 bond fell slightly after opening higher but the market again underperformed Germany. The yield gap widened two basis points to 152. \par \par \uc2  1500 GMT vs 1500 GMT on Tuesday \par \par \uc2  * 2007 bond yield four basis points lower at 5.35 pct \par \par \uc2  * Norway 2007 bond gap over Bunds two basis points wider at 152 \par \par \uc2  * Three-month eurokrone rates two basis points higher at 8.40 pct \par \par \uc2  * Crown at 110.84 against the inverse European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  unit (Ecu) index versus 110.21 \par \par \uc2  * Crown at 4.5330 per mark versus 4.4900 \par \par \uc2  ((Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41, fax +47 22 42 00 18, oslo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010923duca006vj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
