\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS- \highlight22\uc2 Norway \highlight\uc2  c.bank says to resume  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tanya Pang \par \uc2 547 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Oktober 1998\par 10:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  OSLO, Oct 16 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Norges Bank, said on Friday it was resuming \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to defend the crown, saying a recent plunge in the oil-backed \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was over-exaggerated. \par \par \uc2  The bank, which suspended monetary policy instruments in late August after seven successive interest rate hikes failed to halt a sharp depreciation in the crown, said the current slide in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was primarily due to international conditions. \par \par \uc2  "The Norwegian economic situation has not undergone substantial changes that justify such a weakening," the bank said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  The crown has declined sharply in recent days, falling overnight to new record lows against the mark mainly because of a renewed softening of oil prices, uncertainty over the 1999 budget and investors' aversion to minority \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  during unrest on international financial markets. \par \par \uc2  Following the bank's announcement, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  recovered to 4.6775 against the mark at 0824 GMT after hitting a low at 4.7380 overnight. Against the inverse European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  unit index it was quoted at 114.29. \par \par \uc2  Norwegian monetary policy is orientated to return the crown over time to a range widely believed to be between 103 and 105 on the Ecu index. \par \par \uc2  The bank's attempts earlier this year to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  led to a 4.50 percentage point surge in its key interest rates, sending the overnight lending rate to 10 percent and the discount rate to eight percent. Norway now has the highest interest rates in western Europe after Greece. \par \par \uc2  Norges Bank noted that monetary policy had resulted in a "significant widening of the interest rate differential" between the crown and European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "This interest rate level, combined with a tight fiscal policy, will also contribute to limiting inflation expectations," it said. "Against this background, Norges Bank will resume \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading as part of its implementation of monetary policy." \par \par \uc2  In a speech in late August, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Kjell Storvik said that it was widely perceived that \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as a rule, had limited effect. \par \par \uc2  But Harald Boehn, head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said on Friday that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had now become a more suitable tool. \par \par \uc2  "We have to a larger degree than previously been influenced by international factors which have affected the crown, and therefore \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be a more effective instrument," Boehn told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the bank's participation should help dampen excessive volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "I think this will be stabilising and contribute to an appreciation of the crown," said Harald Magnus Andreassen, chief economist at Elcon securities. \par \par \uc2  "This is an extremely irrational market. This shows that Norges Bank doesn't believe it has earned such a weak crown and what that will mean for the dangers if increased inflation." \par \par \uc2  Others, however, said it might set off speculation. \par \par \uc2  "It's not obvious what will happen now. Norges Bank could stop the weakening trend we have seen, or this could start speculation all over again. Which of these will dominate it is too early to tell," said Solveig Erlandsen, economist at Handelsbanken. \par \par \uc2  ((Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41, fax +47 22 42 00 18, oslo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113duag0217o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
