\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Norway \highlight\uc2  NOK firms as C.Bank resumes  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 609 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Oktober 1998\par 17:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  1400 GMT - The Norwegian crown strengthened from overnight record lows against the mark after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced it would resume \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The bank, which abandoned the use of interest rates to support the crown in late August, said the crown's recent weakening was mainly linked to international conditions and was not justified by the Norwegian economic situation. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  should help increase activity on the thin market, which has helped to exaggerate moves in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "It is good that Norges Bank will help to increase liquidity (through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). It is positive that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have a more active role." \par \par \uc2  Overnight the crown fell to a low against the mark of 4.7380, continuing the downtrend of earlier this week. \par \par \uc2  Money-market rates fell in line with the crown's firming and players said they expected further declines next week. \par \par \uc2  Long bond yields were also down. The government benchmark S467 bond yield fell 10 basis points and narrowed the spread with German Bunds by 11 basis points to 163. \par \par \uc2  Dealers reported good buying interest across the curve. \par \par \uc2  * 2007 bond yield 10 basis points down at 5.60 pct \par \par \uc2  * Norway 2007 bond gap over Bunds 11 basis points down at 163 \par \par \uc2  * Three-month eurokrone rates five basis points lower at 8.00 pct \par \par \uc2  * Crown at 112.52 against inverse European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  unit (Ecu) index against 114.56 \par \par \uc2  * Crown at 4.6100 per mark vs 4.6790. \par \par \uc2  OSLO, Oct 16 (Reuters) - The Norwegian crown strengthened on Friday after hitting record lows against the mark after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced that it would resume \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The bank, which suspended using interest rates to defend the crown in late August, said the recent weakening of the crown was largely linked to international conditions. \par \par \uc2  "The Norwegian economic situation has not undergone substantial changes to justify such a weakening," Norges Bank said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  The crown, which had hit an overnight record low against the mark at 4.7380, bounced back to stand at 4.6100 at 1400 GMT. Against the inverse European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  index it stood at 112.52 compared with 114.56 a day earlier. \par \par \uc2  "There has been good buying interest in the crown today. We think it can firm even further next week now that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is again involved," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the bank's participation should help dampen excessive volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has been exacerbated by a thin market. \par \par \uc2  "I think this will be stabilising and contribute to an appreciation of the crown," said Harald Magnus Andreassen, chief economist at Elcon securities. \par \par \uc2  "This is an extremely irrational market. This shows that Norges Bank doesn't believe it has earned such a weak crown and what that will mean for the dangers if increased inflation." \par \par \uc2  Others, however, said it might set off speculation. \par \par \uc2  "It's not obvious what will happen now. Norges Bank could stop the weakening trend we have seen, or this could start speculation all over again. Which of these will dominate it is too early to tell," said Solveig Erlandsen, economist at Handelsbanken. \par \par \uc2  Short rates crept down on the announcement, the three-month swap rate declining five basis points to 8.00 percent. \par \par \uc2  Long debt yields also fell. The government benchmark S467 bond yield slid 10 basis points to 5.60 percent and narrowed the \par \par \uc2  ((Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41, fax +47 22 42 00 18, oslo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113duag01zsj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
