\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Norway \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk/ \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\uc2  -2:As Part Of Monetary Policy \b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Oktober 1998\par 09:47\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (Dow Jones)--Norges Bank, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said Friday it will resume \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as part of implementing its monetary policy mandate of maintaining a stable krone. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the recent weakening of the krone (NOK) was largely a result of international developments, and wasn't justified by Norwegian economic fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  The krone hit an all-time low of NOK4.7380 against the Deutsche mark overnight, but in spot trade early Friday, the Norwegian unit had rebounded to NOK4.6765 per mark. \par \par \uc2  "Monetary policy, which has resulted in a significant widening of the interest rate differential between the Norwegian krone and European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is oriented towards bringing the krone exchange rate over time back to its initial range," Norges Bank said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  Norges Bank has previously indicated it prefers the krone to trade in a range between 103 to 105 on the weighted ECU index. In early trade Friday, the krone stood at 114.37 on the index. \par \par \uc2  According to the bank, Norway's interest rate level combined with a tight fiscal policy will also contribute to damping inflation expectations. Against this background Norges Bank said it would resume \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as part of its implementation of monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been forced to boost its key interest rates seven times this year by a total of 4.5 percentage points in the face of a sagging krone. Those moves have taken the banks deposit rate to 8% and the overnight lending rate to 10%. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 16-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0747GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duag006ac\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
