\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Norway \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk Says  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Has Limited Effect \b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 September 1998\par 12:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Kjell Storvik said Thursday that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets isn't a very effective tool to affect the value of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Our experience is in line with experience from other central banks, that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a limited effect," Storvik said at press conference. "We've used other and more powerful means too," Storvik said. \par \par \uc2  Indeed, faced with a sagging Norwegian krone the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has boosted its key interest rate corridor seven times this year, raising it a total of 4.5 percentage points to stem the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's slide. \par \par \uc2  Storvik noted Norges Bank's view on the desirability of market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be at odds with many market participants' view. "I'm sure many would just like Norges Bank to offer some cheap kroner in the market." \par \par \uc2  Asked why Denmark's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has chosen to use market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past week to prop the Danish krone, Storvik argued that Denmark is in an entirely different situation. Denmark plans to join the successor to to Europe's exchange-rate mechanism, while Norway isn't taking part. \par \par \uc2  "Denmark has also used the interest rate weapon," he added. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, Danmarks Nationalbank raised its floor discount and deposit rates by 50 basis points, and its repo rate by 1 percentage point. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 23-09-98 \par \par \uc2  1038GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9n086fx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
