\par\par \b \uc2  Norges Bank Checked Mkt Prices, May Have  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2 -Traders \b0\par\par\uc2 223 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1998\par 16:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (Dow Jones)--According to Oslo-based \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers Norges Bank, \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been checking prices, and possibly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said Norges Bank, the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been checking prices to buy kroner and even possibly been buying kroner for marks just above the NOK4.2500 level. \par \par \uc2  At 1440 GMT, the mark fetched NOK4.2465, down from its intraday peak of NOK4.2565 reached in mid-morning trade. \par \par \uc2  "Rumor has it that that Norges Bank was checking prices through Den Norske Bank, and we saw some (krone) buying in Norway after that," said a dealer with a Norwegian financial institution. He noted there had been heavy volumes flowing through the market all day, although there was nothing dramatic about this. \par \par \uc2  The Norwegian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  resumed its practice of periodic \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market earlier this month, after nearly 18 months of abstinence, in an effort to lift the sagging \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and abide by its only monetary policy of maintaining a stable krone. \par \par \uc2  Previously the Norwegian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's weakness prompted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost its key interest rate corridor four times this year \par \par \uc2  As a matter of policy, Norges Bank declines to comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-07-98 \par \par \uc2  1448GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du7u06fyy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
