\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Norway \highlight\uc2  NOK stable, dealers say C.Bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 306 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juli 1998\par 16:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  1400 GMT - The crown was steady for most of Thursday's session and dealers said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy crowns for marks. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is in the market offering marks for crowns," said one dealer who declined to be named. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the crown was between 4.2450 and 4.2500 versus the mark. \par \par \uc2  Norges Bank declined to comment on its market activities saying that it releases such information one week later. \par \par \uc2  Since Monday the crown has recovered from last week's six-year lows, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hiked its key interest rates by 0.50 percentage points. \par \par \uc2  However, by 1400 GMT the crown had slipped slightly to 4.2455 against the mark. \par \par \uc2  Long bonds were little changed over the day, and the yield spread between Norway's S467 government benchmark bond due 2007 and German Bunds was stable at 72 basis points. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers reported good bidding interest for long Norwegian paper. "There was surprisingly good interest for bonds in spite of the weak crown," said another dealer. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, Statistics Norway will release fresh inflation figures for June. A Reuters poll of 10 analysts forecast consumer prices to rise by 2.2 percent year-on-year and by 0.3 percent from May. \par \par \uc2  * 2007 bond yield one basis point lower at 5.41 pct \par \par \uc2  * Norway 2007 bond gap over Bunds unchanged at 72 basis points \par \par \uc2  * Three month eurokrone rates two basis points up at 5.32 pct \par \par \uc2  * Crown at 104.97 against inverse European \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Unit (Ecu) index vs 104.92 \par \par \uc2  * Crown at 4.2455 against the mark versus 4.2440 \par \par \uc2  ((Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41, fax +47 22 42 00 18, oslo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du79019di\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
